[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3 uid="uid://unittextmeshdeffont"]

; The one variable: no `font` on the TextMesh, which then draws Godot's default font. Every other
; TextMesh golden names a font file, so none shows the default font. The scene is that of
; unit-text-mesh.tscn otherwise: the left text has depth, the right text has none, and the glyphs 8, a
; and A hold the holes and the curves.

